#: ../../../reference/administration/network-requirements.md:10
msgid ""
"Both the snap daemon (snapd) and [Snapcraft](https://"
"documentation.ubuntu.com/snapcraft/stable/) require network access to "
"install, update, build and publish snaps. This page lists the hosts and "
"ports (`host:port`) that are required to ensure consistent communication."
